    "abstract": null,
    "field": "Climate impact of aviation",
    "problem": "Previous studies provided incomplete estimates of aviation's climate impact because they only focused on easily observable line-shaped contrails, lacking methods to simulate the full life cycle of contrail cirrus and their interaction with natural clouds.",
    "method": "This paper uses a global climate model incorporating a process-based contrail-cirrus module to simulate the full life cycle of contrails, their global coverage, and the resulting radiative forcing, including their interaction with natural clouds.",
    "task": "The task is to use a global climate model to simulate the complete life cycle of contrail cirrus to determine their global coverage, associated radiative forcing, and their effect on natural cloudiness.",
